      m_Calls: []
  m_text: 'Ilona, 2019


    HEDY TJIN


    Hedy Tjin is an illustrative designer.
    In her work she expresses her fascination for patterns and designs, reflecting
    the influence of cultural and ethnic subjects.



    Her love of working with
    a felt-tip pen is driven by the freedom to be able to draw anywhere and at any
    time, often with a therapeutic effect.



    She records loved ones and snapshots.
    Sadly, her Aunt Ilona came into her life late and left too early.

'
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
