      m_Calls: []
  m_text: Vaillant made a true likeness of this man with an individual appearance
    . However, this print appears to have been made to sell to collectors, not commissioned
    by the sitter. Vaillant was an expert in mezzotint, a technique for making prints
    in different shades of black. It was obviously also ideal for depicting dark
    skin.
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
