      m_Calls: []
  m_text: "Hollandse Meesters Her-Zien: Debora Nassy, 2020\r\nCIGDEM YUKSEL (fotografie),
    J\xD6RGEN TJON A FONG (concept)\r\n\r\nDebora Nassy was a woman of colour who
    worked as a servant in Amsterdam. When she was about to leave for Guyana, she
    visited a notary to make sure that she would not be taken into slavery overseas.
    Her employer, the Jewish-Portuguese David Nassy, declared that Debora \u2013
    \u2018a brown female or mulatta\u2019 \u2013 was born in freedom in his house
    and was raised as a free person. "
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
  m_sharedMaterial: {fileID: 2180264, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
